I was once asked to give a lecture at a university in Cambridge, England. It’s a bit of a shock for me because I’m not used to giving lectures in English, let alone one on a subject I’m not really an expert on.

It’s about the future, and I have to talk about what life will be like in 50 years from now, when we get to the point where we can travel through time as well.

I’m a big fan of the time travel genre, so I’m looking forward to it.

Anyway, here’s my lecture. 

